Comment: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.07,Caption Top,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Maternal Health Record
Comment: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:27.16,Caption Top,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Admittance Guide
Comment: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:47.06,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,== OP ==
Comment: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:48.84,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,== ED ==
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:08.94,Default,TV Voice,0000,0000,0000,,If you're a Type B, you need to take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:13.15,Default,TV Voice,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave it alone, it can become a serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:14.70,Default,TV Voice,0000,0000,0000,,life-threatening, situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:15.82,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:19.28,Default,TV Voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}But worry not, for we'll reveal the solution to your problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:18.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This show is disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:24.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's really nothing to be scared of...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How about a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:31.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Am I gonna die too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:32.38,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:37.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What're you talking about? You're only six years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:21.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:31.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't decide on a kindergarten soon, I'll be screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard of talented people in huge companies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:37.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,with day-care centers at the workplace...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:41.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Like hell, that'd be a company around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:48.52,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:54.27,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi, did you get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:55.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:57.15,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,You're going home early all the time these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:58.90,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:01.88,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,You always used to take the last train, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:05.70,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Last year, sales went through the roof because of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:06.99,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,but if you stopped working as hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:11.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I didn't make so many sales because of enthusiasm or tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:13.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I was just lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:15.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,After all, my name's Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.21,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.21,0:03:18.71,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:22.59,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:23.68,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:24.97,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to the 4th floor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:27.35,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. Doing well, as always?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:29.02,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, this guy was just pressuring me to do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:32.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it's making me go bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:36.69,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough after raising the bar so high, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:42.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Gotou, do you really have a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.62,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It's because I'm short, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:48.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's just that you're so thin, I can't picture you pregnant...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.62,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:52.75,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's already two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.00,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. Just put 'em down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:57.92,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:59.80,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:01.05,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:02.63,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.16,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,She's as powerful as ever, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:10.39,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,If only Gotou had stayed in sales...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:13.85,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's worked here for years longer than I have,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:17.44,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but after getting pregnant, she requested a demotion
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,just so she could go home at the same time every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:23.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone in the company was talking about her...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:29.83,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going to take care of her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We didn't really decide on that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.33,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's been wetting the bed lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:40.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can tell that it really embarrasses her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:43.17,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's an emotional thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:46.89,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You'd be surprised at how much kids sweat,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:49.18,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,though they don't do it as much in the fall or winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.10,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,They pee more then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:53.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I was always told...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:55.39,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Pee before going to bed".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:05:00.27,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother must've had her reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:02.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd ask her if I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:06.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mothers are important, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:08.62,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,If you're any kind of man, you'd never say die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.53,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.03,0:05:12.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:18.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I read picture books... and had a staring contest...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was it fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:29.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'm gonna make dinner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The moon's deflated, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.19,0:05:50.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:51.95,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:54.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine, thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:55.66,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not asking about {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:58.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:02.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second, I thought you didn't want to be involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:03.92,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one that's taking care of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:05.59,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,so I can't help but be involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:11.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna try to find a clue about Rin's mother this weekend,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:13.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll be out of your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:17.27,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I see... Then give me a call when you reach the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:19.60,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure you dress that girl warmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:22.44,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I'll invite Haruko, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:25.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It seems she's friendly with her girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:30.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We passed another car!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you're having a good time...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:34.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.29,0:06:40.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:43.54,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:45.92,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:47.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:58.03,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I don't have anything a kid would enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:07:02.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She likes old people stuff anyway. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.98,0:07:05.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:08.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't come crying to me if you're hungry later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:10.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm stuffed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I couldn't finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.79,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.08,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:25.67,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,That was awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.42,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What was with that annoying family?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:32.22,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.72,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,You seriously took custody of her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.35,0:07:36.39,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:41.44,Default,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,And now for the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:44.44,Default,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,It's sunny and warm all over the country today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:46.47,Default,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Temperatures in all regions are about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.47,0:07:48.15,Default,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}2 degrees higher than the average for this time of year,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:50.74,Default,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}making it pleasant weather everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:50.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna head to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.24,Default,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Now, let's look at the forecast for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I need to use the toilet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:09.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go with you sitting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:13.13,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Is she always like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:15.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:18.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's a lot more talkative at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:22.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She even had fun on the train, acting like she was going on a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:24.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now that we're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:27.56,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,all we have to greet us are the uptight people who were at the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:31.32,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What're you trying to say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:36.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Moron. If the adults are in a bad mood, kids will think they did something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:40.74,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.96,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It may have been that way for you kids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:48.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See?! Insensitive as you are, you were the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:50.84,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And Rin's smarter than you ever were!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:51.67,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:03.64,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you like cat's cradle, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, at least answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:12.32,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give this one to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:23.66,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Watch Auntie do it first, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:26.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Auntie"? You mean "Grandma", don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:30.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're not old enough to be my grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:33.21,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my! What a good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:36.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's because her standard for being old is crazy-high!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:37.88,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Watch me do it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:43.68,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Did I do it wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:47.89,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:51.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This? A 4-step ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:52.57,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,How nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A 2-step ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:58.49,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,An airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:09:59.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:01.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.24,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:08.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's easy with this kind of yarn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:09.67,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:12.59,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I knitted it from some thin wool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:14.55,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Doing that makes it the perfect weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:16.30,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Much better than just making loops with woolen yarn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:20.01,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I know! Since she's good with her hands, I bet she can do beanbags, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:24.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You hook it around your little finger like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:26.47,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.47,0:10:27.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:35.11,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, buckle my shoe. Three, four, knock at the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:37.03,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?! What the heck is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:39.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"What is this"? Isn't this what you wanted?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:41.78,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:42.95,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:44.58,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It might be Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.41,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.41,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,These are so pretty! What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:50.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're beanbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:54.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:54.13,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You do it like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.25,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:55.25,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:59.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Like this. And you sing a song as you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:59.09,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really impressed that you can juggle working and raising a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:00.76,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}It's hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:03.43,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,My husband won't help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:02.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Auntie taught me how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:03.60,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Who's Auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Daikichi's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.51,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to Grandpa's house from now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:07.81,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}That's not Auntie, that's Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:10.06,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I thought I might find a clue about Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.98,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Isn't this a pretty string?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:10.98,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:12.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}It's really easy to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:14.73,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After all, I think having a mother is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:14.81,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Maybe I can do it well, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:16.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Go like this, then this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:17.86,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:11.41,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, you could've at least written a will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:13.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you worried about Rin at all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:25.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A modem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's with that hair?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She made it like Reina's!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:40.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Those aren't your clothes either...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're Kazumi's!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:44.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah? Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:48.62,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, she can't wear old, out-of-style clothes like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:52.04,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,But she looks so nice in them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:56.00,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:13:00.25,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,They do look fine on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:01.46,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}This brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:02.42,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,So, how was Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:05.30,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}These were from when you were 4, Kazumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:05.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't find a single clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:06.99,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.99,0:13:11.10,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Either way, we probably shouldn't bug Rin about these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:15.35,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,You're doing your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.56,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think we ever told you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:21.57,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,After you were born, Mom went back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:25.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She wasn't a housewife the entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:28.24,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,When she was pregnant with Kazumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:30.83,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,she wore herself too thin and had to be hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.04,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Upon returning to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:35.29,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Mom found that they didn't want her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:39.36,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,It made her so unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:42.21,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,And Kazumi was so tiny when she was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:47.68,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Mom often took off work and came home early for you kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:50.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And what about Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:54.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She gave Kazumi all of her attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:57.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so she became the arrogant and bossy woman you see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:03.77,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,How are you on time? Do you want Dad to drop you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:06.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, that's all right. We'll still make it in time if we walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.25,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we come back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She wants to know if she can come back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:28.93,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie will be here waiting for you, so come back anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:30.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:38.98,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:41.35,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with wanting a grandchild?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:42.98,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'd take care of the baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:45.86,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't work and raise a child at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:48.11,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's too much for just one woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:51.41,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I still wanna wear a swimsuit and go out drinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:58.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin, did Grandpa have a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:00.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you even know what a computer is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:01.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.93,0:15:04.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did Grandpa use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:06.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The maid used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:08.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He had a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.17,0:15:10.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Her name was Masako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:12.30,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Maternal Health Record Masako Yoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:17.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What was she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:21.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:39.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like Masako...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:44.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She hated me and she was always angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:46.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I was scared of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:48.42,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I don't think about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:52.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:15:57.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little late to be saying this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.51,0:16:00.56,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but it's tough to work full-time and raise a kid, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.77,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You've got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:04.06,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,There's never a dull moment, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:12.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you ever feel like you were sacrificing yourself for your child?{merged}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.91,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Do you mean my demotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:17.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I know I'm overstepping my bounds but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:21.01,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I thought it was the best choice at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:23.16,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,and it turned out all right, so I have no problem with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:30.76,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,If I ever did feel that though,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.01,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:35.22,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You know how powerful words can be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.89,0:16:37.89,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,What was it... "Saying it makes it true"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:40.09,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Does that make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.09,0:16:41.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:43.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I understand exactly what you mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:47.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you'll give me more advice in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:51.65,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi, your child is older than mine, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:55.07,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You should be giving {\i1}me{\i0} advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.89,0:17:22.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:24.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:26.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But it's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:29.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:34.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have a bad dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:39.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's it like to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:43.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, are you gonna die before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:47.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sadness about Grandpa's death...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Anxiety over what would happen if I died...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fear of her own death...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.63,0:17:59.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She isn't able to sort these things out, so she's a mess inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:04.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, everything will be fine 'til you're a young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:08.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,When will I start to be a young woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:12.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I mean everything will be fine 'til you're a middle-aged lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:15.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Until then, I am {\i1}not{\i0} gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:16.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Count on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:24.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And don't worry about wetting the bed either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine as long as you go to the toilet before bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:28.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The toilet is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:30.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go with you at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you still have an accident after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:34.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,all we have to do is change your pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:38.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will you be mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:42.68,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing to be mad about, and it's nothing to be laughed at for, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:44.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:49.73,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,What did you want to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:52.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry this is so sudden, Hidaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:55.86,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well... this is out of the blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:58.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but I need you to transfer me to a department without overtime work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.57,0:19:02.57,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,What? Kawachi... Are you serious about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.70,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Completely serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:09.25,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So that's what's been happening with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:11.79,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Personally, I think it's a real shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:14.42,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,but I've got a kid, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:17.92,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best to convince the section chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:20.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I really appreciate your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:24.55,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,You do know your men will make a fuss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:26.68,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:28.72,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Why'd it have to be you, Kawachi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:31.19,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Can't another relative take her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:33.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't tell him that I insisted on taking her in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:38.03,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,And aren't there nursery schools that'll keep the kids 'til late at night?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:41.11,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna work for anyone but you, Kawachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:44.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know this is sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:48.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but higher-ups often make sudden transfers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:49.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make a big deal out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.38,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,However... I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:20:00.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You'll all manage without me though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:02.38,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They should be able to shuffle people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:04.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If not, then there's something seriously wrong with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:07.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let Rin go on like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not making a bad decision...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:11.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:13.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:16.19,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you finish?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:18.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is this enough rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.19,0:20:19.19,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.73,0:20:23.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Towel, lunch box, slippers, toothbrush, cup...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.53,0:20:24.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and your name on everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:25.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A futon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:27.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's just for babies...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:28.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:34.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.71,0:20:43.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you were to ask me right now, I'd be lying if I said this didn't feel like a sacrifice. {merged}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:47.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice though, if I can look back on all this one day and say that she was worth every second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.52,0:22:24.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, the thing on your towel and your lunch box...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.51,0:22:25.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.65,0:22:28.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like a dog with huge ears...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.07,0:22:29.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.61,0:22:32.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's Lop Ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:35.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Lop...? It's a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:36.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.41,0:22:39.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a little dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:40.17,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:42.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.51,0:22:50.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's go pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.93,0:22:52.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I already went!
